        "original_id": "0598c275-9b13-5f4b-8fb5-1993b3427a44",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eddie Cahill, Jim Craig, Kevin Williamson, Poppy Montgomery\n- Works: Miracle, Friends, Glory Days\n- Roles: Tag Jones, Detective Don Flack, Jim Craig\n- Events: 1980 U.S. Olympic hockey team, Lake Placid Winter Games\n\nFacts:\n- Jim Craig was born on May 31, 1957, and he is a retired American ice hockey goaltender.\n- Jim Craig was part of the 1980 U.S. Olympic hockey team that won the gold medal at the Lake Placid Winter Games.\n- Eddie Cahill was born on January 15, 1978, and he is an American actor.\n- Eddie Cahill portrayed goalie Jim Craig in the film Miracle.\n- Eddie Cahill played Tag Jones on Friends.\n- Eddie Cahill played Detective Don Flack.\n- Kevin Williamson created the 2002 TV series Glory Days.\n- Glory Days starred Eddie Cahill and Poppy Montgomery.",
